<section class="section section-tint"><div class="shell two-column"><div><p class="eyebrow">Development review</p><h2>Plan first, then build.</h2><p>Brooktrails properties are subject to development standards and a review process consistent with the Brooktrails Specific Plan adopted by Mendocino County. Township staff, and the District Architect when required, evaluate proposed plans.</p><p>The district and county jointly administer the Brooktrails Specific Plan and its 2004 amendments.</p><a class="button" href="../contact/">Contact the Township office</a></div><div class="resource-panel"><h3>Planning packet</h3>${['Development Standards','Design Review Application','Water Meter Construction','Chapter 20.232','Ordinance 121','Ordinance 112','2004 Specific Plan'].map(q=>{const d=findDoc(q);return d?`<a href="../${d.file}">${escapeHtml(d.title)} <span>↓</span></a>`:''}).join('')}</div></div></section>
